{"id":"417cabd731eca511","group":"91","path":"91/91-lem-gap-sentence-stability-proof.md","title":"极小gap不蕴含全固定点稳定gap","display":"lem-gap-sentence-stability-proof — 极小gap不蕴含全固定点稳定gap","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-lem-gap-sentence-stability-proof","aliases":["91-lem-gap-sentence-stability-proof","91-lem-gap-stable-proof","91-lem-gap-proof"],"display":"lem-gap-sentence-stability-proof — 极小gap不蕴含全固定点稳定gap","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-teller]]","[[91-df-stable-sentence]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-lem-gap-sentence-stability-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-lem-gap-sentence-stability-proof</span><span>91-lem-gap-stable-proof</span><span>91-lem-gap-proof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-gap-sentence-stability-proof — 极小gap不蕴含全固定点稳定gap"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"724d38bcb2abeb43\" href=\"?note=724d38bcb2abeb43\" title=\"91-df-truth-teller\">91-df-truth-teller</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3a19d5715745463a\" href=\"?note=3a19d5715745463a\" title=\"91-df-stable-sentence\">91-df-stable-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-gap-sentence-stability-proof-—-极小-gap-不蕴含全固定点稳定-gap\">lem-gap-sentence-stability-proof — 极小 gap 不蕴含全固定点稳定 gap</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> (满足\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})\">\\(\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})\\)</span>\n的真理陈述者)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\min}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\min}\\)</span> (强 Kleene 跳跃的极小一致固定点)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\)</span> (强 Kleene 跳跃的一致固定点类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gap}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Gap}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\)</span> (句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 中既不真也不假)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StableGap}(\\varphi)\\equiv\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,\\mathrm{Gap}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{StableGap}(\\varphi)\\equiv\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,\\mathrm{Gap}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\)</span> (稳定间隙)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gap\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}stability\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Gap}_{\\Gamma_{\\min}}(\\tau)\n\\land\n\\exists\\Gamma^+\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,(\\tau\\in\\Gamma^+)\n\\land\n\\exists\\Gamma^-\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,(\\neg\\tau\\in\\Gamma^-)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gap\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}stability\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Gap}_{\\Gamma_{\\min}}(\\tau)\n\\land\n\\exists\\Gamma^+\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,(\\tau\\in\\Gamma^+)\n\\land\n\\exists\\Gamma^-\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,(\\neg\\tau\\in\\Gamma^-)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>从而</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gap}_{\\Gamma_{\\min}}(\\tau)\n\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{StableGap}(\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Gap}_{\\Gamma_{\\min}}(\\tau)\n\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{StableGap}(\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从空信息迭代时，真理陈述者没有外部事实启动其真假，故保持 gap。\n但选择它为真或为假并对该选择作强 Kleene 闭包，可得到相应的一致\n固定点。因此“在极小构造的所有阶段都未进入”只描述该构造，不能推出\n它在所有固定点中都未进入。</p>\n<p>说谎者若在所有一致固定点中保持 gap，需要使用其特殊对角方程另证，\n不能由一般的极小固定点 gap 性质推出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-gap-sentence-stability-proof-—-极小-gap-不蕴含全固定点稳定-gap","text":"lem-gap-sentence-stability-proof — 极小 gap 不蕴含全固定点稳定 gap","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-teller","status":"resolved","id":"724d38bcb2abeb43","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-teller]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-stable-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"3a19d5715745463a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-stable-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\min}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Gap}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StableGap}(\\varphi)\\equiv\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,\\mathrm{Gap}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gap\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}stability\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Gap}_{\\Gamma_{\\min}}(\\tau)\n\\land\n\\exists\\Gamma^+\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,(\\tau\\in\\Gamma^+)\n\\land\n\\exists\\Gamma^-\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,(\\neg\\tau\\in\\Gamma^-)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Gap}_{\\Gamma_{\\min}}(\\tau)\n\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{StableGap}(\\tau).","display":true}],"bytes":1790,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["724d38bcb2abeb43","3a19d5715745463a","460308c7099a8386"]}